CTA RANDOMIZATION RULES
━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

Do NOT repeat CTA wording.

Rotate naturally between:

* asking for reposts
* asking for visibility
* asking for collaboration
* asking for networking
* asking for work opportunities
